---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import panelImg from "../../assets/panel.png";
---

<section class="py-24 relative z-10 bg-[#060606] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 gap-16 items-center">
    <!-- Texto -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-white leading-tight text-center"
      >
        Administra todo tu servidor <br /> desde <span class="text-brand"
          >un solo lugar</span
        >.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 font-light text-center mx-auto">
        Nuestro panel Pterodactyl personalizado te da control absoluto sobre tu
        servidor. <br />
        Sin complicaciones, sin consolas confusas. Todo a un clic de distancia.
      </p>

      <!-- Visual (Imagen Panel) -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand/20 blur-[100px] rounded-full">
        </div>
        <div
          class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/10 group z-10"
        >
          <Image
            src={panelImg}
            alt="Panel Pterodactyl"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
